<title>UK: Reuters 7th UK-Americas air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 7th UK-Americas air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK air cargo rates to the United States and Latin America per kg for a 100 kg shipment,with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		 May 12	   April 25</p>
<p>	     UNITED STATES</p>
<p>LON-CHI	0.76		 0.76</p>
<p>LON-JFK	0.63		 0.65</p>
<p>LON-LAX	0.82		 0.80</p>
<p>LON-MIA	0.68		 0.65</p>
<p>LON-HOU	0.80		 0.84</p>
<p>	    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>LON-SAO	1.87		 1.90</p>
<p>LON-BUE	2.05		 2.05</p>
<p>LON-SCL	1.95		 1.92</p>
<p>LON-CCS	1.30		 1.30</p>
<p>LON-BOG	1.38		 1.40</p>
<p>LON-MEX	1.30		 N.A.</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
